 in `server.ts` and `src/db/schema.ts`, and `varchar` seems ideal for the role length. I\'m also addressing the roles of who can create other roles. I\'m fixing `server.ts` to reflect role-based access for account creation, restricting admin and teacher creation based on the creator\'s role.\n\n\n"
